# Game_React2P — 2-Player Reaction Battle (ID 13)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_React2P.h, Game_React2P.cpp
# HTML: data/game_react2p_setup.html, game_react2p_names.html, game_react2p_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Two players per group compete: press your puck first when target color appears.
1-5 groups possible. Optional fake distractor colors. Tracks reaction times and averages.

## CONFIG
- numGroups (1-5), pucksPerGroup (3-10), timeLimit (default 90s)
- colorsPerPlayer (1-3): colors shown pre-game
- useFakeColors: enable distractors (Yellow/Orange/White/Gold)

## STATES per group
R2_SETUP → R2_PRE_SHOW → R2_COUNTDOWN (3s) → R2_WAITING (1.5-4s random) → R2_RUNNING → R2_SHOW_WIN (1.5s) → loop back → R2_FINISHED

## KEY MECHANICS
- P1 colors: Red/Magenta/DeepPink, P2 colors: Blue/Cyan/Lime
- Each round: random wait, then show player colors on pucks
- First correct press wins round, scores point
- Frozen timer on stop (stoppedTime preserved)
- Per-group independent control (grp_start, grp_stop)
- Average reaction time: totalReactionTime / score

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_groups, cfg_pucks, cfg_time, cfg_colors, cfg_fake, start, reset, stop, exit, grp_start, grp_stop

## STATUS JSON
{time, limit, groups: [{id, st, gT, p1s, p2s, p1a (avg RT), p2a, p1c (colors), p2c}]}
